  <item>
    <title>[eP.044] 男生女生如厕大揭秘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b8ce605faf368659e6f166</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b8ce605faf368659e6f166</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft6eDKcLxmotWFuyzJktjYfDGw5z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>嘿，各位"蹲友"！欢迎来到“马桶上的言诞疯听”这期我们专门分享那些让人脸红心跳又忍俊不禁的如厕时刻。</span><br><span>今天咱们不聊一泻千里闲情逸致的享受时刻，只分享那些发生在厕所里让人抓狂的名场面！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 开启有味道的话题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 女生厕所一直一直一直一直一直排长队</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 男生的如厕礼仪和有趣的如厕体验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 女生更喜欢马桶还是蹲坑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 选择的厕所包间位置反应了人物性格</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 上厕所遇到领导要打招呼吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 荒唐的玻璃隔断</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a> 上厕所也不能耽误接业主电话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> 厕所里的偷拍狂魔</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> 走错厕所咯咯咯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2801">46:41</a> 妈妈带小男孩进厕所引发冲突</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3097">51:37</a> 马桶圈世纪之战情侣分手原因 TOP5 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 超级有料大彩蛋，私密大曝光！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：可达Koduk/抓抓er/索纳斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：六六</span><br><span>本期BGM:噗噗交响曲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhqcUGkkNAMbjpAMBidbdbEtfxd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
